<title>INDIA: Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill rises to 7.77 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on Indian 91-day t-bill rises to 7.77 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Friday it set a cut-off rate of 98.10 rupees at its weekly auction of 91-day treasury bills, down from 98.16 rupees at last week's auction.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield worked out to 7.77 percent, up from 7.52 percent at the previous auction.  </p>
